    "details": {
      "isComplex": false,
      "level": {
        "value": 4
      },
      "disable": "<p>@Check[type:thievery|dc:21] (trained) to disable the blade</p>",
      "description": "<p>The chest in this room is one of the boys’ favorite toys. Although not locked, the chest’s lid sticks and must be wrenched open with a @Check[type:athletics|dc:25] check. Opening the chest triggers no traps and reveals a sack of coins within. Unfortunately, the coins sit on a pressure trigger set to release a cleverly concealed war razor housed within the wall of the chest. As soon as the sack is lifted, this blade snaps out with tremendous force. The blade is also laced with poison. The boys enjoy daring each other to “beat the blade,” but not quite as much as telling prisoners that they’ll be let free if they can get the chest open and steal the coins.</p>",
      "reset": "The trap resets after 15 minutes.",
